<title>UK: DSL Bank sets $250 mln two-year bond.</title>
<headline>DSL Bank sets $250 mln two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Commerzbank and Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DSL BANK</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     6.25 PCT  MATURITY    25.JUN.99</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  100.789   PAY DATE    25.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.125     REOFFER    99.789    YIELD	 FLAT</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LUX</p>
<p> IBCA	 AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10-100  SALE LIMITS</p>
<p>US/UK/JP/DE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.125     SELL CONC  1.0</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
